年齢よりも大人びていて、そそる肢体をしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"34822"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14458","sourceWorkId":"12237","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"c","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14458","sourceWorkId":"12237","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"166 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14458","sourceWorkId":"12237","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14458","sourceWorkId":"12237","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14458","sourceWorkId":"12237","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"44 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14458","sourceWorkId":"12237","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/895afa1436be5eba5dcc181130c69d0764b182f6699971bcd7325261e95d0056.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de4fce788a60ffcb5603da0c3a8b3ea66c77e4d08bf3cd057de5033960e024ae.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田崎由美子","creatorId":"vndb:s4453","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4453","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4453","name":"田崎 由美子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:142755:34822:24694:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c23761","characterName":"宮本 日向","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"34823","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"142755"},{"characterId":"34823","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"142756"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14459"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23761"},"originalCharacterName":"宮本 日向","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"42"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"少年のような口調の元気ハツラツな女子生徒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明朗快活な性格なのか、楽観主義なのか男性に対しても、無防備な面が目立つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツで有名な「薔薇百合女子学園」の生徒で、テニスで全国で名が知られている選手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近は、カメラ小僧に付きまとわれて困っているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体つきは、スポーツで引き締まり、健康的な弾力のある肌をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「痴漢って犯罪じゃん。キミ、やめなよ。」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14459","sourceWorkId":"12237","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく活発で、考えるよりも体を動かすほうが得意なタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人懐っこい性格をしており、異性に対しても無防備な女子校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツ全般が得意で、自分では女の子っぽくないと気にしているが女の子らしい身体つきに十分成長している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"電車内でぶつかった相手・俊輔に一目惚れをしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"俊輔の正体を知り、悩み苦しみ、敏感になっていく自分の身体を 認めることができないでいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、痴漢をされ続け、酷いことをされても、俊輔への想いが変わらない自分は本当に彼が好きなのだと知る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初恋の相手である俊輔に、いつものように積極的な言動を取っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、表には出さないが、ひそかに悩んでいることがあるらしく、いつもの笑顔に多少の翳りが現れ始めていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「えっへへぇ……胸がドキドキしっぱなしだよ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14459","sourceWorkId":"13014","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょんなことから電車内で知り合った女子学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少年のような口調の元気ハツラツ娘。明朗快活な性格なのか、はたまた楽観主義なのか、男性に対しても無防備な面が目立つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツで有名な 『薔薇